Error: Jet.ValueTypeMismatch: `both` wants fn() for argument 1, but this is fn() -[]> Int
  --> move_lambda_construction_consumes_owned_nonscalar_captures.jet:8:10
    |
  8 |     both(fn() { values.len() }, values)
